    "detailed_description": "Thunder Chase pits you against never ending missiles. Protected by a time slowing Armor and with various Boosts, survive as long as you can!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speed Boost</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/f381d948a2c57fcac172d85bebc00bbb.poster.avif?t=1550086994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/f381d948a2c57fcac172d85bebc00bbb.webm?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/f381d948a2c57fcac172d85bebc00bbb.mp4?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Gain boost to your speed to navigate through difficult situations and avoid being swarmed by enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Armor</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/415c8263fe5f34247941ff72db4670ab.poster.avif?t=1550086994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/415c8263fe5f34247941ff72db4670ab.webm?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/415c8263fe5f34247941ff72db4670ab.mp4?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>After being hit, your Armor allows you to endure a few more hits without taking damage and also slows time for a while.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Decoy Bomb</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/837de0f7cb2842a9466f759a6ca3d7f2.poster.avif?t=1550086994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/837de0f7cb2842a9466f759a6ca3d7f2.webm?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/837de0f7cb2842a9466f759a6ca3d7f2.mp4?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Drop off a decoy bomb, which attracts all active missiles to itself for a while and destroys unlucky ones close to it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EMP</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/5d25938fb42bd5ba41d7138c52045cf4.poster.avif?t=1550086994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/5d25938fb42bd5ba41d7138c52045cf4.webm?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762270/extras/5d25938fb42bd5ba41d7138c52045cf4.mp4?t=1550086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Fire a massive blast, which destroys every enemy. They are few in number so save some for impossible situations.",
